# Pins the bd commit that the generated CLI docs describe and are validated
# against: docs/CLI_REFERENCE.md, docs/cli-reference/, and the CLI Reference
# pages array in docs/docs.json.
#
# The pin is a full commit sha, not a tag, because origin serves no tags. It
# must be a commit this checkout contains; the docs pipeline builds bd from
# that commit (CGO_ENABLED=0, pure Go — CI's canonical build) instead of the
# current checkout. Bump it to the origin/main tip, and run
# ./scripts/generate-cli-docs.sh, whenever the CLI surface changes.
#
# Set to HEAD to track the current checkout's source instead (the pre-pin
# behavior).
8ccca4456d74fe770ee2e6b36f5c34ed619864af
